From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: denfry <dabinayo@pm.me>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 11:36:43 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] Add /tessera lag

/tps lists the regions with the highest tick times, but not what makes
them slow. /tessera lag [regions] lists the busiest regions over the
last 15 seconds with their entities and ticking block entities by type
and the chunk with the most entities, collected on each region's own
thread. Locations are clickable to teleport. Permission
tessera.command.lag.

